The sources of the glacial river are inside the fortresses of the Snow Lady and the Snowstorm Dragon.

Glacies and her fairies, together with the Elemental Priestesses, have already begun the plan to lure the Snow Lady.
We will lure the Snowstorm Dragon using Kelvezu, who defeated it in the past. The ice dragon must still resent it. To bring Kelvezu to it, we will use this egg. Kelvezu will come after the egg.
You must take the egg to the Frozen Abyss of the Sea.

Come back when you are ready. I will look after the egg for you.

Receive 394,439,798,437 experience points as a reward for your effort.
